rd_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1821611005:0":{"text":"병에 걸린 잠입자가 이렇게 많다니, 이번에 암초 해운이 한몫 크게 했나 보네요. 보너스도 꽤 받겠군요?","source_cn":"居然有这么多生病的偷渡者，看来这次你们暗礁航运干了一票...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1296F43709EA07D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1821611006:1":{"text":"저기요! 사람 구하러 온 거예요, 잡담하러 온 거예요?!","source_cn":"喂！你到底是来救人的还是来闲聊的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD53504EF697DF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1821611007:1":{"text":"그래요... 지금 중요한 건 이게 아니니까, 일단 사람부터 구하자고요!","source_cn":"是啊……先别说这些了，快想办法救人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0F007472EF5EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1821611008:1":{"text":"한 명이라도 잘못되면 제 보너스가 전부 날아가니까요!","source_cn":"但凡有一个人出事，我的奖金就全打水漂了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54C18C4C7BC5A03E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1821611009:0":{"text":"그래요. 하나씩 볼 테니까 서두르지 말아요.","source_cn":"哼，知道了。一个个看，别急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x155A91FAF29512D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_